{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"帖撒羅尼迦前書","commonName":"帖撒羅尼迦前書","title":"帖撒羅尼迦前書","order":52,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"29881629b06ca3a5c4aa25d7c5fc025cbcd7c1b00dc61155c04f262a6cdf9c73","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":89},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["問候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["保羅、西拉、提摩太寫信給帖撒羅尼迦在父上帝和主耶穌基督裏的教會。願恩惠、平安歸與你們！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["帖撒羅尼迦信徒的信心和榜樣"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我們為你們眾人常常感謝上帝，禱告的時候提到你們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["在上帝－我們的父面前，不住地記念你們因信心所做的工夫，因愛心所受的勞苦，因盼望我們主耶穌基督所存的忍耐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["被上帝所愛的弟兄啊，我知道你們是蒙揀選的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因為我們的福音傳到你們那裏，不獨在乎言語，也在乎權能和聖靈，並充足的信心。正如你們知道，我們在你們那裏，為你們的緣故是怎樣為人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["並且你們在大難之中，蒙了聖靈所賜的喜樂，領受真道就效法我們，也效法了主；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["甚至你們作了馬其頓和亞該亞所有信主之人的榜樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["因為主的道從你們那裏已經傳揚出來。你們向上帝的信心不但在馬其頓和亞該亞，就是在各處也都傳開了，所以不用我們說甚麼話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["因為他們自己已經報明我們是怎樣進到你們那裏，你們是怎樣離棄偶像，歸向上帝，要服事那又真又活的上帝，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等候他兒子從天降臨，就是他從死裏復活的－那位救我們脫離將來忿怒的耶穌。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/COL/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}